# Agent scratch. The repo states its own scratch conventions rather than leaving
# each clone to configure them: these two were carried in .git/info/exclude, which
# is machine-local and shared with nobody, so the model scan was red by default on
# any clone that had run an agent session and green only by accident elsewhere.
scratchpad/
.claude/worktrees/
